{"Title":"An Act relative to municipal building officials","BillNumber":"H2461","DocketNumber":"HD1690","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T16:52:19.203"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T16:52:19.2033333"},{"Id":"RMH2","Name":"Ryan M. Hamilton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RMH2","ResponseDate":"2024-01-23T15:36:39.04"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2461/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Chan of Quincy, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2461) of Tackey Chan relative to retirement for municipal building officials.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. The definition of “Group 2” as set forth in subparagraph (g) of paragraph (2) of section 3 of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the words, “Public works building police”, the following:- “; municipal building officials certified by the Commonwealth”.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}